  "ingredients": [
    "1/3 cup chia seeds",
    "1/3 cup flaxseed meal",
    "3 ounce cauliflower (riced)",
    "1 cup pecans (crushed)",
    "3 1/2 cup unsweetened carton coconut milk",
    "1 1/2 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon maple extract",
    "1/2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/4 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "1/4 teaspoon ground allspice",
    "3 tablespoon erythritol (powdered)",
    "10 drop liquid stevia (to taste)",
    "1/4 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "3 tablespoon butter",
    "3 ounce cream cheese",
    "1/8 teaspoon xanthan gum (optional)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out the chia seeds and flaxseed meal and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3684.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a food processor to rice the cauliflower. Set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3696.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the raw pecans to a Ziploc bag and use a rolling pin to crush them. Make sure they're not too small; they should add a bit of texture to the dish.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toast the pecans in a pan over low heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3716.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a saucepan, heat up the coconut milk. Once warm, add in the cauliflower and continue to cook until it begins to boil.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn the heat down to medium-low and add in the cinnamon, maple extract, vanilla, nutmeg, and allspice.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3723.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a spice grinder to powder the erythritol. (Let settle before removing lid of grinder)",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3739.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the powdered erythritol and liquid stevia to the pan and stir them in well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3742.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the flaxseed meal and chia seeds to the pan and mix well. The mixture should begin to thicken.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3748.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Measure out the heavy cream, butter, and cream cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3751.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the mixture is hot again, add in the toasted pecans, cream, butter, and cream cheese. Mix together well. Optional: Whisk in a bit of xanthan gum for a thicker oatmeal.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_3757.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cinnamon-roll-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-51343-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
